{"id":"rustVector","name":"Rust: Vector","description":"Rust 集合类型动态数组Vector常用方法","level":"代码练习","cover":"💻","category":"代码练习","language":"code","words":[{"id":"rustVector_00001","word":"Vec::new()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::new()` 方法创建并返回一个新的空 `Vec`，它没有任何元素。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00002","word":"Vec::with_capacity()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::with_capacity()` 方法创建一个指定容量的空 `Vec`。容量用于优化内存分配，减少需要扩展时的内存重分配次数。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00003","word":"Vec::push()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::push()` 方法将一个元素追加到 `Vec` 的末尾。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00004","word":"Vec::pop()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::pop()` 方法移除并返回 `Vec` 中的最后一个元素。如果 `Vec` 是空的，返回 `None`。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00005","word":"Vec::len()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::len()` 方法返回 `Vec` 中元素的个数。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00006","word":"Vec::is_empty()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::is_empty()` 方法返回一个布尔值，表示 `Vec` 是否为空。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00007","word":"Vec::clear()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::clear()` 方法移除 `Vec` 中的所有元素，但不改变其容量。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00008","word":"Vec::contains()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::contains()` 方法检查 `Vec` 中是否包含指定的元素。返回一个布尔值。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00009","word":"Vec::remove()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::remove()` 方法移除并返回 `Vec` 中指定索引处的元素，其他元素会左移。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00010","word":"Vec::retain()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::retain()` 方法保留符合指定条件的元素，移除不符合条件的元素。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00011","word":"Vec::swap_remove()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::swap_remove()` 方法移除并返回指定位置的元素，并将该元素与 `Vec` 中最后一个元素交换，以便避免元素的移动。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00012","word":"Vec::resize()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::resize()` 方法调整 `Vec` 的大小。如果新大小大于原大小，元素将会按指定值填充。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00013","word":"Vec::truncate()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::truncate()` 方法将 `Vec` 截断到指定的长度，多余的元素会被丢弃。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00014","word":"Vec::get()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::get()` 方法通过索引获取 `Vec` 中的元素，返回一个 `Option`，如果索引越界，则返回 `None`。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00015","word":"Vec::index()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::index()` 方法与 `get()` 类似，但在越界时会引发 `panic`。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00016","word":"Vec::clone()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::clone()` 方法返回一个 `Vec` 的克隆，包含相同的元素。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00017","word":"Vec::extend()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::extend()` 方法将另一个可迭代对象的元素追加到当前 `Vec` 的末尾。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00018","word":"Vec::insert()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::insert()` 方法在指定位置插入一个元素，后续元素会右移。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00019","word":"Vec::insert_many()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::insert_many()` 方法在指定位置插入多个元素。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00020","word":"Vec::split_off()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::split_off()` 方法将 `Vec` 分割为两个 `Vec`，返回包含从指定索引开始的部分，原 `Vec` 只包含从开头到指定索引的部分。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00021","word":"Vec::shrink_to_fit()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::shrink_to_fit()` 方法尝试减少 `Vec` 的容量，以便释放未使用的内存。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00022","word":"Vec::sort()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::sort()` 方法对 `Vec` 中的元素进行排序，默认按升序排列。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00023","word":"Vec::sort_by()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::sort_by()` 方法根据指定的排序规则对 `Vec` 中的元素进行排序。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00024","word":"Vec::sort_unstable()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::sort_unstable()` 方法对 `Vec` 中的元素进行排序，但不保证稳定排序（即相等元素的顺序可能会改变）。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00025","word":"Vec::binary_search()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::binary_search()` 方法对已排序的 `Vec` 进行二分查找，返回目标值的索引（如果找到）。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00026","word":"Vec::dedup()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::dedup()` 方法移除 `Vec` 中的相邻重复元素。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00027","word":"Vec::dedup_by()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::dedup_by()` 方法根据指定的闭包去重，移除不符合条件的相邻重复元素。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"},{"id":"rustVector_00028","word":"Vec::into_boxed_slice()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`Vec::into_boxed_slice()` 方法将 `Vec` 转换为 `Box<[T]>`，即一个堆分配的切片。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustVector"}]}